#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:1
msgid "4.1 Video Stream Data"
msgstr "4.1 视频流数据"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:4
msgid ""
"Video streams from the front and rear wide‑angle cameras are pushed via "
"GStreamer to the following URLs:"
msgstr "前后广角相机的视频分别以Gstreamer方式推流到以下URL:"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:9
msgid ""
"By default, the live video feed is pulled and displayed on the remote-"
"controller. The streams can also be previewed and accessed using VLC or "
"ffplay. Examples:<br>"
msgstr "默认会在遥控器侧拉流显示实时画面，可通过 VLC 或者 ffplay 进行预览和调用，例如："

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:10
msgid ""
"**case1:On a Windows PC connected to the robot's Wi‑Fi, use VLC to view "
"the video stream:**"
msgstr "**case1:在 windows 电脑连接四足机器人 wifi，可通过 VLC 软件进行视频流数据查看：**"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:11
msgid ""
"step1:Open VLC, click \"Media → Open Network Stream\" "
"![图片](images/VLC_Step1.png)"
msgstr ""
"step1:打开 vlc，点击\"媒体-->打开网络串流\""
"![图片](images/VLC_Step1.png)"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:11
#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:13
#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:16
msgid "图片"
msgstr "图片"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:13
msgid ""
"step2:Enter the stream URL, e.g., `rtsp://192.168.234.1:8554/front`<br> "
"![图片](images/VLC_Step2.png)"
msgstr ""
"step2:输入设备推流地址： `rtsp://192.168.234.1:8554/front`<br>"
"![图片](images/VLC_Step2.png)"

#: ../../source/4.1Video_Stream_Data.md:16
msgid "step3:Preview the video<br> ![图片](images/VLC_Step3.png)"
msgstr "step3:预览画面<br> ![图片](images/VLC_Step3.png)"

